gress to destroy an enemy program. You just need to redefine the terms.\n\nLook at what he did with the \"Public Charge\" rule. He didn\u2019t pass a law saying", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 8959}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2118712470093119651", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToZ3DL60", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 790, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8928090, "raw_content": "", "author": "grannylovestrump", "created": 1794018620152, "profile_picture": "J2VOs7hvr5If", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Hanging_Chad", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToZ3DL60.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/QuantumGuard17/status/2118712470093119651", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Kavanaugh wasn\u2019t having it.\n\u201cIndependent agencies aren\u2019t accountable to the people. They\u2019re not elected. Yet they\u2019re exercising MASSIVE power over liberty and billion-dollar industries.\u201d", "last_comment_created": 1794068159001, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 51, "score_up": 790, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 13, "created": 1793975391000, "id": "2118712470093119651", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2118712407409274881/img/_HF3AxJBZu4LuU56.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2118712407409274881/pl/ViME7ZyDahmBorUA.m3u8?v=5ac", "aspectRatio": [16, 9], "heightR